			<div class="content" id="post-content-4833277">
									

<h3><span>All Staff-enacted Deletions are carried out according to the <a href="/deletions-guide">Deletions Guide</a>.</span></h3>
<p>Summary deletions result for:</p>
<ul>
<li>Articles with malicious intent</li>
<li>Pages that are clearly unfinished.</li>
<li>Attempts to &quot;game&quot; site procedure, such as re-posting a non-rewritten article in an attempt to get around downvotes.</li>
<li>Blatantly plagiarized material.</li>
<li>An article posted outside of the current range.</li>
</ul>
<h4><span>If an author attempts to self-delete their work and fails to do so properly, including either by blanking the page or renaming it, it will be deleted properly by Staff.</span></h4>

